<title>UK: World Bank adds 500 mln marks to Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank adds 500 mln marks to Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    18.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.16    PAY DATE  **02.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.785   SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*FUNGIBLE WITH 500 MLN MARK BOND ON 14.JUL.97</p>
<p>		**PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW GERMAN/NY    HOME CTRY  SUPRA</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 119</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
